Package: wb-mqtt-dmx
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-asyncio-mqtt (>= 2.3.1)
Description: DMX512 output from a Wiren Board controller
 Drives DMX512 fixtures and decoders from the controller's own RS-485 ports
 or WBE2 RS-485 modules and publishes them as MQTT devices. A lighting
 console can take a port over through Art-Net or sACN.
